<!-- Main Content Start -->
<main class="main-content">
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>About Us</h2>

            <div class="about-section">
                <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                <p>At the Institute of Fine Arts, we aim to inspire and cultivate artistic expression by providing a nurturing environment where students can discover their creative potential. We are committed to fostering artistic excellence, supporting innovative learning, and promoting the growth of future artists through competitions, exhibitions, and educational programs.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-section">
                <h3>Our Vision</h3>
                <p>We envision a global community of fine artists who contribute to cultural richness and societal development. Our vision is to become a leading institution known for producing skilled and visionary artists, empowering individuals to succeed in both professional art careers and personal creative pursuits.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-section">
                <h3>Our Faculty</h3>
                <p>Our faculty consists of accomplished professionals from various art disciplines, dedicated to helping students develop their unique artistic style. Below are some of our esteemed faculty members:</p>

                <div class="faculty-card">
                    <h4>John Williams</h4>
                    <p><strong>Position:</strong> Senior Art Instructor</p>
                    <p><strong>Specialty:</strong> Abstract Painting & Sculpture</p>
                    <p><strong>Experience:</strong> 15+ years of experience in the art industry, with numerous national and international exhibitions.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faculty-card">
                    <h4>Emma Davis</h4>
                    <p><strong>Position:</strong> Digital Art Instructor</p>
                    <p><strong>Specialty:</strong> Graphic Design & Digital Illustration</p>
                    <p><strong>Experience:</strong> A renowned digital artist with a background in art direction and design for global brands.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faculty-card">
                    <h4>Michael Brown</h4>
                    <p><strong>Position:</strong> Photography & Film Instructor</p>
                    <p><strong>Specialty:</strong> Photography, Cinematography, & Digital Media</p>
                    <p><strong>Experience:</strong> Over 10 years of teaching photography and film, with a passion for storytelling through visuals.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
</main>
<!-- Main Content End --> *@

